# Line-ending policy: shell scripts and patches must be LF in every
# checkout. CRLF working copies (Windows autocrlf) break `git apply` of
# the build-tools patches and ShellCheck (SC1017), and have historically
# stripped executable bits in this bring-up (docs/HANDOVER.md §2 gotcha).
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
